                <pb facs="0237" n="225" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg225"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/1993: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-10-27T16:00:00-04:00">October 27, 1942—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1824. My 1813, October 26, 3 p.m. The Minister of Interior has issued strong
                    orders that the investigation of the PYL espionage group be pursued with utmost
                    vigor.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
